# Keeta App Store reviews: what customers complain about (Gulf + Hong Kong)

*Voice-of-customer readout from {{m.n_reviews|int}} public App Store reviews, snapshot {{snapshot_date}}.
Personal project built 2026-09 by Wenjie Luo from public data only. Not affiliated with Keeta or
Meituan; no internal data. Every number below is generated from `results/` and checked in CI.*

## TL;DR

1. **The written-review channel is a complaint channel.** In the {{ranked.n}} storefronts with enough
   data, {{neg_range|rng_pct0}} of written reviews are 1–2★ (mean
   {{written_mean_range|rng_f2}}★), while the same app's all-ratings store
   average is {{store_avg_range|rng_f2}}★. Read these reviews as a list of
   *what goes wrong*, not as a satisfaction score.
2. **Customer service is the most-mentioned topic in 1–2★ reviews in {{rank1.customer_service.n}} of
   {{ranked.n}} markets** ({{rank1.customer_service.names}}); in the Gulf markets it appears in
   {{cs_gulf_range|rng_pct0}} of complaints.
3. **It is mostly failed service recovery.** Of Gulf complaints that mention customer service,
   {{cooc.gulf.customer_service.payment_refund.share_b_given_a|pct0}} also mention payment/refunds,
   {{cooc.gulf.customer_service.delivery_time.share_b_given_a|pct0}} delivery time and
   {{cooc.gulf.customer_service.order_fulfilment.share_b_given_a|pct0}} a missing/wrong/undelivered order.
4. **UAE is different:** delivery time ({{pain.ae.delivery_time.share|pct0}}) and customer service
   ({{pain.ae.customer_service.share|pct0}}) are statistically tied at the top, and rider behaviour is
   raised in {{pain.ae.rider_behavior.share|pct0}} of complaints (Gulf-wide:
   {{band.gulf.neg.rider_behavior.share|pct0}}).
5. **UAE, {{recent.ae.recent_month}}:** the 1–2★ share of written reviews fell to
   {{recent.ae.negative.recent|pct0}} from {{recent.ae.negative.base|pct0}} in the previous three months,
   while mentions of prices/promos rose to {{recent.ae.labels.pricing_promos.recent|pct0}}
   (from {{recent.ae.labels.pricing_promos.base|pct0}}). This data cannot say why (see below).
6. **Hong Kong** (comparison market): pricing & promos is the second-most-mentioned complaint topic
   ({{pain.hk.pricing_promos.share|pct0}} of 1–2★ reviews).

Method note: labels come from a keyword/rule labeler, which scored **higher** than a local LLM
(qwen2.5:3b) against a {{q.n_reference}}-review reference set (micro-F1
{{qo.rules.micro_f1|f2}} vs {{qo.llm.micro_f1|f2}}). Details and caveats at the end.

